    "summary": "Better for cows, the environment, and your peace of mind.\n\nIn this video, local dairy farmers share why they made the move to composting wintering barns and the significant benefits they\u2019ve seen on-farm. From reducing nutrient leaching to improving animal welfare and staff conditions, hear firsthand how these systems are helping them manage winter challenges more effectively.\n\nLearn more about sustainable farming in Canterbury: https://ecan.govt.nz/wintergrazing",
